@baseUrl = http://localhost:5158

### S0. مستخدم الجلسة — مرة واحدة فقط. المتوقع: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Session User",
  "email": "session@test.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123"
}

### S1. دخول — شغّله أولًا في كل جلسة عمل. المتوقع: 200
# @name s
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "session@test.com", "password": "Password123" }

### S2. مستخدم ثانٍ لإثبات العزل — مرة واحدة. المتوقع: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Other User",
  "email": "other@test.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123"
}

### S3. دخول المستخدم الثاني. المتوقع: 200
# @name other
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "other@test.com", "password": "Password123" }

### 1. تسجيل صحيح - المتوقع: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ahmed Ali3",
  "email": "ahmed3@test.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123"
}

### 2. نفس الإيميل مرة ثانية - المتوقع: ConflictException
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ahmed Ali",
  "email": "ahmed@test.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123"
}

### 3. بيانات غلط - المتوقع: ValidationException
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sara",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123",
  "confirmPassword": "456"
}
